<div class="booking-card">
  <h3>Book your appointment securely</h3>
  <p class="booking-card__intro">Choose the provider that fits how you'd like to pay. Booking and intake happen in <strong>Osmind</strong>, our secure, HIPAA-compliant patient platform.</p>

  <div class="provider-pick">
    <article class="provider-pick__card">
      <span class="pay-badge">Self-pay</span>
      <h4>Dr. Badeea Qureshi, MD</h4>
      <p class="provider-pick__role">Psychiatrist</p>
      <ul class="provider-pick__list">
        <li>Private pay, sliding scale available</li>
        <li>FSA/HSA accepted · superbills provided</li>
      </ul>
      {% set p = booking.qureshi %}{% set btnClass = "btn btn--block" %}{% include "partials/book-button.njk" %}
    </article>
    <article class="provider-pick__card">
      <span class="pay-badge pay-badge--ins">Insurance</span>
      <h4>Francis Agbotse, PMHNP</h4>
      <p class="provider-pick__role">Psychiatric Nurse Practitioner</p>
      <ul class="provider-pick__list">
        <li>Aetna and Ambetter</li>
        <li>Coordinated Care (Medicare + Medicaid)</li>
      </ul>
      {% set p = booking.francis %}{% set btnClass = "btn btn--block" %}{% include "partials/book-button.njk" %}
    </article>
  </div>

  {%- if site.inquiryFormUrl %}
  <p class="booking-card__help">Not sure which provider is right for you, or prefer not to call? <a href="{{ site.inquiryFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fill out our secure request form</a> or call or text <a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>, and our care coordinator will reach out.</p>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="booking-card__help">Not sure which provider is right for you? Call or text <a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> and our care coordinator will help you get started.</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p class="booking-card__help">Already a patient? <a href="{{ site.portalUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Log in to the patient portal</a> to message your provider.</p>

  <p class="privacy-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span><strong>Your privacy matters.</strong> Please don't send medical details by email or text. Your health history is collected securely during intake in Osmind.</span></p>
</div>
